<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northrop Grumman upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northrop Grumman upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded Northrop Grumman Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 77-5/8.</p>
</text>
